        "tags": [
          "todos"
        ],
        "summary": "Create Todo",
        "description": "Create a new todo.\n\nArgs:\n    todo: Todo data to create.\n    db: Database session.\n    current_user: Current authenticated user.\n    \nReturns:\n    Todo: The created todo item.",
